<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  ISO 20022 message definition — pacs.008.001.08 (FIToFICustomerCreditTransferV08).

  A representative subset of the XML Schema the standard publishes for the interbank
  customer credit transfer: the `Document` root, the business element, the group header
  with its settlement instruction, and one credit-transfer transaction with the interbank
  settlement amount, charge bearer, parties, agents and purpose. Hand-authored from the
  published structure; the full definition declares many more components. Message ids,
  structure and type names follow the standard; the data types shared with pain.001 keep
  their names so the two definitions diff and search alike.
-->
